  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "召唤老鼠再用投石车抛过防线，同时架自修盾墙和追踪雷云",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Call forth a rat above every non rat ally, use catapults to catapult those rats past the enemy defenses, meanwhile defend yourself with self repairing shield walls and summon lightning clouds which teleport above enemies and zap them.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "三连射不只影响枪械，还能让蚁丘增产、螃蟹复制和尸体变三只僵尸",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Sure Triple Shot makes your guns shoot 3 bullets sometimes, but it also makes your anthills make more ants, your replicating crabs might triplicate, your dead enemies might turn into 3 zombies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "金币不够可以直接负债，甚至用八层增益交换开发者设计的恶毒诅咒",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Want to buy something in the shop but didn't collect enough gold? Just go into debt! Want to stack a perk 8 times in exchange for some of the most horrible curses my mind could cook up? Cursed trades got you covered!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1958340/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
